   (DESIGN.md's "bit of life" accent), reduced to a single silhouette. The
   status bar tints small icons to a flat colour and discards everything but
   the alpha channel, so this is deliberately one solid opaque path — a
   multi-tone version would render as an unreadable white lump.
-->
